3 首选运行 bundled script，处理 gh field drift 和 job-log fallbacks；添加 --json 以获得机器友好输出；脚本抓取失败 PR checks、拉取 GitHub Actions logs 并提取 failure snippet。\",\"actual_representation\":\"block_005 的 constraints 记录 Preferred script、field drift/job-log fallbacks、--json，以及 fetch/pull/extract 行为；ir_009 的 run_inspect_pr_checks 输入脚本路径、result_001 repo_path、result_005 resolved_pr、literal true，输出 result_006 inspection_report、result_007 inspection_exit_code；ir_010 dispatch 使用 result_007；metadata 嵌入完整 script_content 与 script_path。\",\"reason\":\"首选脚本路径、核心输入、检查报告与退出码输出、以及脚本资源均有记录。literal true 可理解为选择机器友好输出，属于源文允许的具体调用选择，不单独构成参数错误。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"src_044\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":35,\"end_line\":38,\"quote\":\"3. Inspect failing checks (GitHub Actions only).\\n   - Preferred: run the bundled script (handles gh field drift and job-log fallbacks):\\n     - `python \\\"<path-to-skill>/scripts/inspect_pr_checks.py\\\" --repo \\\".\\\" --pr \\\"<number-or-url>\\\"`\\n     - Add `--json` for machine-friendly output.\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_047\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":64,\"end_line\":64,\"quote\":\"Fetch failing PR checks, pull GitHub Actions logs, and extract a failure snippet. Exits non-zero when failures remain so it can be used in automation.\"}],\"controlled_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/4/key\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/4/id\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/4/name\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/4/source\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/4/constraints/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/4/constraints/1\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/4/instructions\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/4/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/4/instructions/0/inputs/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/4/instructions/0/inputs/1\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/4/instructions/0/inputs/2\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/bloc